WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,950
Brother Li Ang, this is for you

2
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:20,500
What kind of work do you do in reality?

3
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,690
Swallow at home

4
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:26,690
With your wisdom, you led everyone to survive, but you can't find a job

5
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,880
No background, can't speak

6
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:31,520
I can only be a delivery person

7
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,520
If you can get out alive

8
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:35,520
You can come to work in my company

9
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:37,520
Forensic company

10
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,520
No, appraisal agency

11
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:42,350
It's a pity that your powers of observation are wasted.
